11:44:55 [DEBUG] trafilatura.main_extractor: discarding element: div None
11:44:55 [DEBUG] trafilatura.main_extractor: discarding element: div None
11:44:55 [DEBUG] trafilatura.main_extractor: extra in p: p O Valor procura as defesas dos condenados.
